mark draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): bodiless `wait`, `stop`, `write`, `close`, `read`, `stream`; process/run runs a command. Nothing loads it.

load @term/base/process
  find child

task wait
  mark async
  take child, like child
  like size

task stop
  take child, like child
  take
    form
    like text
    fall text <gentle>

task write
  mark async
  take child, like child
  take data, like text

task close
  mark async
  take child, like child

task read
  mark async
  take child, like child
  take
    kind
    like text
    fall text <stdout>
  take
    format
    like text
    fall text <text>
  like text

task stream
  mark async
  take child, like child
  take
    kind
    like text
    fall text <stdout>
  take
    format
    like text
    fall text <bytes>
  like list
